type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Exact sparse matrices in portable JSON format and mathematical verification
  software accompanying A uniform trigonometric R-matrix for the exceptional
  series. Includes checks of representation relations, unitarity, crossing
  symmetry and the generic parametrised Yang–Baxter equation.
license: CC-BY-4.0
title: "Exact representation matrices and audits for A uniform trigonometric R-matrix for the exceptional series"
